<!--
  Ode to Joy
  Theme of the finale of Symphony No. 9 (1824), words by Friedrich Schiller. Public domain.
  C major, 4/4, quarter = 104, 16 bars (37 s). Right hand: the melody, G3-G4.
  Left hand: roots C3 and G3, one or two per bar. Every note is in C3-B4.
  In bar 12 the melody's low G3 sounds over the held left-hand C3.

  bar | right hand     | left hand | words
    1 | E4 E4 F4 G4    | C3        | Freu-de, schö-ner
    2 | G4 F4 E4 D4    | G3        | Göt-ter-fun-ken,
    3 | C4 C4 D4 E4    | C3        | Toch-ter aus E-
    4 | E4 D4 D4       | G3        | -ly-si-um,
    5 | E4 E4 F4 G4    | C3        | wir be-tre-ten
    6 | G4 F4 E4 D4    | G3        | feu-er-trun-ken,
    7 | C4 C4 D4 E4    | C3        | Himm-li-sche, dein
    8 | D4 C4 C4       | G3 C3     | Hei-lig-tum!
    9 | D4 D4 E4 C4    | G3 C3     | Dei-ne Zau-ber
   10 | D4 E4 F4 E4 C4 | G3 C3     | bin-den wie-der,
   11 | D4 E4 F4 E4 D4 | G3        | was die Mo-de
   12 | C4 D4 G3       | C3        | streng ge-teilt;
   13 | E4 E4 F4 G4    | C3        | al-le Men-schen
   14 | G4 F4 E4 D4    | G3        | wer-den Brü-der,
   15 | C4 C4 D4 E4    | C3        | wo dein sanf-ter
   16 | D4 C4 C4       | G3 C3     | Flü-gel weilt.
-->
